					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011603,
					"content": "原来杜林这么好学吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011604,
					"content": "我只是觉得我应该多学习一下这个世界的常识…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011605,
					"content": "为什么杜林会这么觉得？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011606,
					"content": "嗯…派蒙知道吗？在蒙德，使用火焰捕猎鱼类是要接受惩罚的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011607,
					"content": "…你跟可莉一起去炸鱼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 160011608,
					"content": "我本来以为是在向可莉学习捕猎技巧，直到后来被琴团长抓到禁闭室，我才发觉事情不是我理解的那样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011609,
					"content": "这个世界的很多常识都和希穆兰卡不一样，我必须抓紧学习，以免再给大家制造麻烦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011610,
					"content": "该说是常识的问题吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
